    "directions": [
      "In a handi, add mustard oil, once it's smoky hot, add bay leaf, dry red chili, nigella seeds, fennel seeds, small mustard seeds, cumin seeds, fenugreek seeds and let it splutter well.",
      "Add onions, ginger, a pinch of asafoetida and cook it for a while until translucent.",
      "Add turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, coriander powder, curd and saute it for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Add fresh tomato puree, salt to taste and let it cook for a while until cooked well.",
      "Add water, mango pickle and simmer it for 4-5 minutes.",
      "Add water to adjust the consistency, sugar, sauteed paneer & green chili and give it a quick boil.",
      "Finish it with fresh coriander leaves and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or paratha.",
      "In a mixer grinder jar, add cashew nuts, tomatoes and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Transfer it to a pourer or bowl and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add mustard oil, once it's smoky hot, add green chillies, paneer, degi red chili powder and gently toss it for a minute.",
      "Cook the paneer for 4-5 minutes on medium flames and keep it aside for further use."
    ],
